# 🛠 SKILL — Git Push to Cosda

> **Authority**: CRD canon + Distribution layer rule
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/git-push-cosda.ail`

---

## SK-GPC-1 — Setup (một lần)

```powershell
# Load PAT từ t:/keys/github.txt
$PAT = Get-Content t:/keys/github.txt | Select-Object -Last 1
# PAT classic for Cosda-dev: ghp_... (per t:/keys/github.txt)

# Configure git credential helper (PowerShell)
git config --global credential.helper store
# Hoặc dùng PAT trực tiếp trong remote URL (one-time)
```

## SK-GPC-2 — Recipe: Push to gh:cosda-dev/*

```powershell
# Trong local repo (vd: ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/)
Set-Location ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/

# Verify git initialized
if (-not (Test-Path .git)) {
    git init
    git checkout -b main
    git remote add origin https://ghp_$PAT@github.com/cosda-dev/<repo>.git
}

# Stage + commit
git add -A
git commit -m "<conventional-commit-style>: <summary>"

# Push to main
git push -u origin main

# Tag release (sau khi Builder seal)
git tag -a v0.1.0 -m "<release notes>"
git push origin v0.1.0
```

## SK-GPC-3 — Recipe: Push to gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym

```powershell
# Sync Olym local → GitHub remote
Set-Location t:/gopia/olym/

# Verify git initialized
if (-not (Test-Path .git)) {
    git init
    git checkout -b main
    git remote add origin https://ghp_$PAT@github.com/hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym.git
}

# Stage canonical artifacts
git add k/cogninfer/ c/ g/ s/ olym-structure-rule.ail README.md

# Commit with Olym canon signature
git commit -m "OLYM: update canonical artifacts (k/cogninfer/*, c/, g/, s/)"

# Push
git push -u origin main

# Tag Olym release
git tag -a olym-v1.2.0 -m "<release notes>"
git push origin olym-v1.2.0
```

## SK-GPC-4 — Conventional Commit

```yaml
commit_format:
  type:
    - feat       # new feature
    - fix        # bug fix
    - docs       # documentation only
    - refactor   # code refactor
    - test       # add/modify test
    - chore      # tooling, deps
    - seal       # CSA seal artifact
    - canon      # canonical update
    - olym       # Olym canon update
  scope:
    - engine    # ha:/engine/
    - caw       # caw:/
    - workspace # ws:/
    - olym      # go:/olym/
    - skill     # skill file
    - rule      # rule file
  example: |
    feat(engine): add text-ractor actor v0.1.0
    fix(caw): resolve cargo check path-deps error
    canon(olym): add k/cogninfer/rules v1.0.0
    seal(engine): CSA-seal hace-actor-text v0.1.0
```

## SK-GPC-5 — PAT Rotation

```yaml
pat_management:
  location: "t:/keys/github.txt"
  format: |
    PAT for Cosda: github_pat_<REDACTED — load from t:/keys/github.txt>
    PAT classic for Cosda-dev: ghp_<REDACTED — load from t:/keys/github.txt>
  rotation: "monthly"
  rotation_owner: "CSA + CSO"
  audit: "Publisher log each PAT use"
```

## SK-GPC-6 — Security

| Rule | Why |
|---|---|
| KHÔNG commit PAT vào git | Token leak |
| KHÔNG log PAT vào stderr | Token leak |
| Sử dụng `credential.helper store` thay vì inline | Reduce leak surface |
| Rotate PAT monthly | Hygiene |
| Audit PAT use | Forensic |

## SK-GPC-7 — Pre-push Checklist

- [ ] Code đã pass `cargo check --release` + `cargo test --release`
- [ ] Artifact đã được CSA seal (nếu là engine parts)
- [ ] Manifest đã được tạo + signed
- [ ] Commit message đúng conventional format
- [ ] Tag version theo semver (vX.Y.Z)
- [ ] README + CHANGELOG đã update
- [ ] Auditor đã verify MAY/MAY-NOT compliance

